      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:6bc4kwdt7yiy7nwvz5md3hvx/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxmehdspdc2m",
      "text": "The Whites are home🤍\nThis weekend saw Swansea return to St Helen's for their 1st game home, played in front of a busy JCP Solicitors Stand 😍\nOn Thursday, they go again vs Cardiff💪\nThis is a key event in the lead up to Ospreys v Dragons, and we need you there!\n🎟️ ospreys.info/SRFCvCAR",
      "author": "Ospreys Rugby",
      "handle": "ospreysofficial.bsky.social",
