      "text": "Scotland U20 star Jake Dalziel is in line for his Newcastle Red Bulls debut when they face Exeter Chiefs this afternoon, after a late call-up to the matchday squad\n🔗 shorturl.at/WvS3M",
      "author": "Scotland Rugby News",
      "handle": "scotlandrugbynews.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:3pzepjafmdqgrchkqdypeuea/bafkreif6g7jwyai2bngdxa3yek5mioziprgypfj3hvtxrlme6silqltyba",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/scotlandrugbynews.bsky.social/post/3mxm4vu6d5q2v",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-11T13:39:57.641Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:3pzepjafmdqgrchkqdypeuea/bafkreihezvob7j7eono54mdlk6obhdeu2g6ulbf4sbkwm5cru57ror4hay",
