      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:6bc4kwdt7yiy7nwvz5md3hvx/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxlqul2h7k2e",
      "text": "Touchline talk with Sam Parry and Morgan Morris 🗣️\n\"It's class, the fans came down in numbers. We're just really looking forward to getting home to St Helen's and seeing them all down there.\" - Sam Parry\n\"Next up it's Europe and two Welsh Derbies, you can't ask for much better.\" - Morgan Morris",
      "author": "Ospreys Rugby",
      "handle": "ospreysofficial.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:6bc4kwdt7yiy7nwvz5md3hvx/bafkreif3alq7ds6ovtohg4i53b2p2zyp2mfjgboaqzsqtfdxgxekue2joi",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/ospreysofficial.bsky.social/post/3mxlqul2h7k2e",
