      "text": "Magnus Bradbury produced another outstanding performance for Edinburgh as they recorded a third win of the season to go top of the URC table\nShould he be in the Scotland team next month?\n🔗 shorturl.at/P6R2l",
      "author": "Scotland Rugby News",
      "handle": "scotlandrugbynews.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:3pzepjafmdqgrchkqdypeuea/bafkreif6g7jwyai2bngdxa3yek5mioziprgypfj3hvtxrlme6silqltyba",
